1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,357
Boss! Boss! I made da buggy go fasta!

2
00:00:04,007 --> 00:00:06,209
'Ow'd ya do dat?

3
00:00:06,859 --> 00:00:09,041
I painted it RED!

4
00:00:09,691 --> 00:00:13,918
Sarge... paint doesn't make things faster. Right?

5
00:00:14,568 --> 00:00:17,337
For Orks? It does.

6
00:00:18,287 --> 00:00:20,758
WAAAAAGH!

7
00:00:21,308 --> 00:00:26,188
Orks believe it, so it's true. Don't think about it, Private.

8
00:00:27,138 --> 00:00:29,713
Paint EVERYFINK red!

9
00:00:31,713 --> 00:00:33,745
...What are you doing?

10
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:36,258
Worth a shot, Sarge.

11
00:00:36,858 --> 00:00:39,924
Oi, lads! That one's red! It's one of ours!

12
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:43,539
SAAAARGE!

13
00:00:44,089 --> 00:00:47,097
Desertion. At remarkable speed.

